    "text": "I, Dayasiri Jayasekara, Minister of Sports, by virtue of powers vested in me in terms of Section 54 (3) of the Gazette(Extraordinary) No. 1825/ 38 published on 30th of August 2013 under Section 41 of the Sports Act, No. 25 of 1973, dohereby direct Kaludura Shantha Ruwanchandra de Silva, the Director General of the Department of Sports Developmentto convene and conduct the Election of Sri Lanka Cricket to elect new office bearers.",
